    "b-10-architecture-the-maintained-map-with-7": {
      "id": "b-10-architecture-the-maintained-map-with-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The maintained map, with each package's ownership, the main flows, extension points and the checks that enforce each boundary, is "
        },
        {
          "insert": ".archon/architecture.md",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "link": "https://github.com/coleam00/Archon/blob/dev/.archon/architecture.md"
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " in the repository. It is kept beside the code, and CI checks declared package dependencies against the linked layering policy."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-architecture-fresh-branch-runs-fi-8": {
      "id": "b-10-architecture-fresh-branch-runs-fi-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Fresh "
        },
        {
          "insert": "--branch",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " runs first reuse a healthy active task worktree registered in Archon for the project and branch, regardless of its path. If no healthy active task registration was reused, the provider can reuse a usable checkout at the configured target path; a holder at another path produces "
        },
        {
          "insert": "branch_checked_out",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", whether or not it is registered in Archon. Before detaching or removing the named holder, check whether a live Archon run still needs it and preserve its changes once it is safe to proceed. Exact-branch continuation can also adopt a Git-registered holder at another path. Reuse emits a "
        },
        {
          "insert": "worktree_adopted",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " warning and records adoption provenance; it does not grant cleanup ownership. The shared "
        },
        {
          "insert": "store recipe",
          "attributes": {
            "link": "https://github.com/coleam00/Archon/blob/dev/packages/isolation/src/store.ts"
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " owns registration and guarded adoption. The "
        },
        {
          "insert": "worktree provider",
          "attributes": {
            "link": "https://github.com/coleam00/Archon/blob/dev/packages/isolation/src/providers/worktree.ts"
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " creates checkouts. The "
        },
        {
          "insert": "isolation resolver",
          "attributes": {
            "link": "https://github.com/coleam00/Archon/blob/dev/packages/isolation/src/resolver.ts"
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " selects worktrees. The resolver and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "launch helper",
          "attributes": {
            "link": "https://github.com/coleam00/Archon/blob/dev/packages/core/src/workflows/registered-worktree.ts"
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " call the store recipe."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
